What this pack holds
  The defensive material from the upstream repository only: the Sigma and
  Suricata rules, the ATT&CK Navigator layer, the indicator CSV and MISP event,
  the host-triage script, the detection test harness with its recorded
  fixtures, and the English defence guide. The pack ships no part of the ARTEX
  application, none of its agent prompts and none of its offensive skills.

